summary:
  The Edit dialog's OK writes every field as the dialog showed it, whatever
  the popup wrote to the row meanwhile.

history:
  Measured on the page on 2026-11-02: a rename put a healed station back on
  its dead address and lost the logo the popup had found while the dialog
  was open. Only the fields changed in the dialog are written now.

target:
  package/contents/ui/DoorLogic.js

find:
          if (shown[k] !== opened[k]) out[k] = clean[k];

replace:
          out[k] = clean[k];

expect:
  Killed by tst_doorlogic::test_a_rename_after_a_heal_keeps_what_the_popup_wrote.
  Line-neutral.
